From bdde4d88100293a48d4c4502d3d5430ac2cadcc0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lateautumn233 <lateautumn233@foxmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 11:50:11 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 36/47] k27: CONFIG_FIRMLINKS on

APFS sets the firmlinks of the System volume (com.apple.fs.firmlink) through vnode_setasfirmlink and the name cache follows them;
without CONFIG_FIRMLINKS the KPI is a stub and no firmlink of the volume group is stitched.

(cherry picked from commit b84cfb2a621c1af02c81c97d7f6509f10ddfb7c1)
---
 config/MASTER.arm64.bcm2837 | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/config/MASTER.arm64.bcm2837 b/config/MASTER.arm64.bcm2837
index a10a62b..d19205f 100644
--- a/config/MASTER.arm64.bcm2837
+++ b/config/MASTER.arm64.bcm2837
@@ -33,7 +33,7 @@
